  John Wade @LtJohnWade • Oct 18
  You also can't talk about the assassination of Charlie Kirk without
  talking about MOSSAD; we have had this fully confirmed by trusted intel
  sources. The REAL assassins stood to Kirk's right and were assisted by one
  and possibly more of Kirk's own security team. Sad & alarming.
